        <p>The third of the series of five monthly competitions was held at the Range last Saturday. The weather was not very favolnahle, the failing light making shooting difficult and curtailing the number of entries. Tw.nty two members took part in the competitions all of which were fired at 100 yards range under II:sley con- ditions. The following scores were made :</p>
