        <p>E. Pollard E. Howard A. Down C. W. Bswyer l2B H. Potts • ll6</p>
        <p>To gain one of these cartitlcates, 115 points out of a possible 130 are required. The Tieasurer to the Club has kindly offered as special prizes three silver shooting spoons. These will be presented to the members making the three highest scores in the Open Sweepstakes competition on the occasion of the next monthly club competitions shoot, which will take place at the end of the present month. Only members who have paid their subscriptions and , who have not won a spoon this year will be eligible for hese spe:.lial prizes.</p>
